{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/强化动力系统","pageid":8655,"revid":22464,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>强化动力系统</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BC.BA.E5.8C.96.E5.8A.A8.E5.8A.9B.E7.B3.BB.E7.BB.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"强化动力系统\"><b>强化动力系统</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 强化动力系统.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/tvqdg9ic4avecj4b0v8nx05rxuu3gae.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/tvqdg9ic4avecj4b0v8nx05rxuu3gae.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4e/tvqdg9ic4avecj4b0v8nx05rxuu3gae.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />强化动力系统\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战地急救</font></span>]的回复效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">25%</font>，并使目标额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫干扰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫干扰</font></span></span>]（持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合）。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">全装甲麦莎,出击！</font></span>]填充[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">缓冲值</span>]时，自身额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再生1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再生1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫干扰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫干扰</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫定身</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战地急救</font></span>]的回复效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">35%</font>，并使目标额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫干扰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫干扰</font></span></span>]（持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合）。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">全装甲麦莎,出击！</font></span>]填充[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">缓冲值</span>]时，自身额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>点能量，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再生1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再生1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫干扰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫干扰</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫定身</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战地急救</font></span>]的回复效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">50%</font>，并使目标额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫干扰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫干扰</font></span></span>]（持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合）。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">全装甲麦莎,出击！</font></span>]填充[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">缓冲值</span>]时，自身额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">3</font>点能量，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再生2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再生2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫干扰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫干扰</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫定身</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"苏醒之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/40px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/i